@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/topic_summary_endpoints/[endpoint_uuid]
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "TopicSummaryEndpointController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "控制汇总平面的索引行" as DB
Client -> API: GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/topic_summary_endpoints/{endpoint_uuid}
API -> DB: 项目许可/项目范围 + 尺度 UUID
DB --> API: 清除的行
API --> Client: 200, 公开的 JSON
note over API,DB
没有 transactional outbox / 背景表演者/公共活动 / WebSocket
申请的账号数据和代币不能串行
end note
@enduml
